on behalf of one entitled American.

2407
02:06:07.526 --> 02:06:09.653
No, Mr. Sethi. Mr. Sethi. Look...

2408
02:06:09.736 --> 02:06:10.737
I'm here.

2409
02:06:10.821 --> 02:06:13.949
I don't think you know how difficult
