He says yes.

2483
02:12:09.888 --> 02:12:11.557
Thank you, Endo. Thank you.

2484
02:12:13.016 --> 02:12:15.143
He said yes. Yes.

2485
02:12:34.329 --> 02:12:35.497
This little fuck.

2486
