2541
02:24:22.120 --> 02:24:23.664
Say hi to Daddy.

2542
02:24:29.586 --> 02:24:31.964
Yeah, there he is. Say hi.

2543
02:24:42.391 --> 02:24:44.601
Yes. Yeah.
